      "lines": [
        "[D]Thy broken body, [G/D]gracious [Bm]Lord,",
        "[A7/C#]Is [Bm]shadowed [A7]by this [F#/A#]broken [D/A]bread;",
        "[G]The [Em]wine [A7/G]which [Bm/F#]in [A7/E]this cup [Bm]is [F#m]poured,",
        "[Em]Points to the blood which [C]Thou [C#dim]hast [D]shed."
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Verse 2",
      "type": "verse",
      "lines": [
        "[D]And while we meet [G/D]together [Bm/D]thus,",
        "[A7/C#]We [Bm]show [F#/A#]that [A7]we are [F#/A#]one [Bm]in [D/A]Thee;",
        "[G]Thy [Em]precious [Bm/F#]blood [A7/E]was shed [Bm]for [F#m]us,",
        "[Em]Thy death, O Lord, hast [C]set [C#dim]us [D]free!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Verse 3",
      "type": "verse",
      "lines": [
        "[D]We have one hope that [G/D]Thou [D]wilt [Bm]come,",
        "[A7/C#]Thee [Bm]in [F#/A#]the [A7]air we [F#/A#]wait [Bm]to [D/A]see;",
        "[G]When [Em]Thou [A7/G]wilt [Bm/F#]give [A7/E]Thy saints [Bm]a [F#m]home,",
        "[Em]And we shall ever [C]reign [C#dim]with [D]Thee."
